{"id":"wb-7-702","name":"默拉纳额什丁麻扎","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"默拉纳额什丁麻扎","text":"默拉纳额什丁麻扎（维吾尔老文字：مەۋلانە ئەرشىدىن مازىرى，拉丁维吾尔文：Mewlane Ershidin Maziri），又称为默拉纳和卓墓，是将伊斯兰教传入东察合台汗国的和卓额什丁及其家属的麻扎（陵园）。位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区阿克苏地区库车市。是中华人民共和国第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%98%E6%8B%89%E7%BA%B3%E9%A2%9D%E4%BB%80%E4%B8%81%E9%BA%BB%E6%89%8E","revisionId":95021992,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95021992","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fb1e320ab9f1028c7ac3b53e.png","title":"Mewlane_Ershidin_Maziri_(20220608).png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mewlane_Ershidin_Maziri_(20220608).png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/Mewlane_Ershidin_Maziri_%2820220608%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Este Momento","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​默拉纳额什丁麻扎","width":320,"height":240}}